{"id":1140702,"name":"제인·심문 II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"제인·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1140702]}],"trial":{"trial_id":140702,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2024-08-06 14:00:00","diary1":"한동안 자취를 감췄던 악명 높은 은행 강도 조직 '유령'이 신성에서 다시 모습을 드러냈다.\n　　'유령'에 대응하기 위해 치안국에서 새로운 작전을 개시했다.","diary2":"제인은 콜맨을 죽이고 그 자리에서 쓰러졌다.\n　　치안국은 신속히 현장을 접수했다. 곧이어 의료팀과 기자들이 몰려왔다…\n　　제인을 향한 사람들의 시선이 어떻게 달라졌을까… 안간힘을 다해 맞서 싸우다가 강도를 사살한 보안관? 아니면, 악당과 결탁한 내부 관계자? 한때 신성 은행을 턴 흉악한 강도?","evidence":[{"ID":260611,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260612,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":3,"dialogue_id":240702002,"next":[3]},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":3,"dialogue_id":240702005,"next":[6]},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":3,"dialogue_id":240702021,"next":[22]},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240702023,"next":null},{"step":